 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” orthodontist for everyone, but **Dr. Budd at Budd Orthodontics** is a strong Phoenix option to consider: the available information says he is **board-certified by the American Board of Orthodontics** and practices in Phoenix. **Serrano Orthodontics** is another good candidate; its Phoenix practice says both orthodontists are board-certified and offers braces and Invisalign.\n\nI’d compare at least two consultations before choosing. Ask who will personally supervise your treatment, whether braces and Invisalign are both suitable for your bite, what the full fee includes (including retainers and refinements), and how follow-up visits work. The right choice depends on your case, budget, location, and comfort with the orthodontist—not just ratings or awards.",
